 what was sent, who replied, what bounced, which\nauto-replies name a successor ('I've left - contact Jane'). Writes down the true state of every thread.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Reads every outreach thread in Gmail in full: what was sent, who replied, what bounced, which\nauto-replies name a successor ('I've left - contact Jane'). Writes down the true state of every thread.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r125", "type": "rectangle", "x": 576.0, "y": 1352, "width": 948, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1D4ED8", "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 85, "groupIds": ["PHASE 1  -  READ THE INBOX"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 740022945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2027284070, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t126", "type": "text", "x": 590.0, "y": 1359, "width": 876, "height": 39, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6B6B6B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["PHASE 1  -  READ THE INBOX"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 473362757, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1717069483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "reads: Gmail, yesterday's master list -> writes: the thread-state ledger, the master list rebuilt from\nGmail", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "reads: Gmail, yesterday's master list -> writes: the thread-state ledger, the master list rebuilt from\nGmail", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a127", "type": "arrow", "x": 1050.0, "y": 1426, "width": 0, "height": 90, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundCol