 the Rulebook; a number only in the settings file", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r245", "type": "rectangle", "x": 576.0, "y": 5180, "width": 948, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1A1A1A", "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 85, "groupIds": ["CHRIS  -  EACH MORNING"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1749492481, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 642206972, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t246", "type": "text", "x": 590.0, "y": 5187, "width": 876, "height": 39, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6B6B6B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["CHRIS  -  EACH MORNING"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1857893384, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1513034796, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "reads: the morning report, the dossier beside Gmail Drafts, replies and flags -> writes: Email 1 sent,\nreplies, rulings (tonight's run reads them all)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "reads: the morning report, the dossier beside Gmail Drafts, replies and flags -> writes: Email 1 sent,\nreplies, rulings (tonight's run reads them all)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "a247", "type": "arrow", "x": 560.0, "y": 5133.0, "width": 0.0, "height": -3863.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6B6B6B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cycle"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 544913623, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1389934172, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [-430.0, 0], [-430.0, -3863.0], [0.0, -3863.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "t248", "type": "text", "x": 560.0, "y": 5274, "width": 960, "height": 39, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6B6B6B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cycle"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 812580072, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 846947092, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "THE CYCLE (dashed line): what Chris sends and what people reply lands in Gmail. Tonight's run reads Gmail first,\nso every morning's actions are in the records by the next night. Nothing is re-done: the ledgers remember.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "THE CYCLE (dashed line): what Chris sends and what people reply lands in Gmail. Tonight's run reads Gmail first,\nso every morning's actions are in the records by the next night. Nothing is re-done: the ledgers remember.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "r249", "type": "rectangle", "x": 100, "y": 5414, "width": 1900, "height": 300, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#C9C2B0", "backgroundColor": "#F5F1E8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3-sequence"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1107148497, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1893722794, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t250", "type": "text", "x": 120, "y": 5432, "width": 1256, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3-sequ